<title>JAPAN: Ajinomoto says may hold briefing on Friday.</title>
<headline>Ajinomoto says may hold briefing on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ajinomoto Co Inc said on Thursday it was considering holding a news conference around noon on Friday to announce measures it would take after the arrest and indictment of two of its officals on suspicion of illegal payments to corporate racketeers.</p>
</text>
